{"identity": ["steam-release-v1", "app:881020"], "payload": {"about_the_game": "Story<br />\r\nGranblue Fantasy takes place in the Sky Realm, a world where myriad islands float in a great blue expanse. Assume your role as the captain of a skyfaring crew, joined by a scrappy little dragon named Vyrn and a young girl with mysterious powers named Lyria. Together you sail with a colorful cast of crewmates, including kings and misfits alike, for Estalucia, a fabled island beyond the end of the skies.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIn the Zegagrande Skydom, islands are guarded by powerful creatures known as primal beasts and winds carry tales of a secretive organization known as the Church of Avia. Unveil a web of intrigue reaching far beyond the borders of Zegagrande and engage in a battle for the fate of the Sky Realm itself.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGameplay<br />\r\nEngage in real-time combat with a party of four in this character action RPG—choose from a diverse roster of skyfarers, each with their own unique weapons, skills, and combat styles. Teamwork makes the dream work with party-based mechanics such as Link Attacks and Chain Bursts to help you crush foes in spectacular fashion.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTackle quests solo or with the help of others for up to 4-player co-op and take down treacherous foes to score rare loot to further enhance your gear. Every enemy and party formation has its own strengths and weaknesses—the key to victory lies in working out how these pieces fit together.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nFast-paced combat not your thing? Assist modes can provide accessibility for gamers of all skill levels. Toggle on Full Assist to have all actions performed automatically during battle!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe Sky Realm is rich in lore and history. Browse Lyria's journal at any point during the game to access a trove of writings on the world's peoples, places, and more. In addition to the wealth of side quests available, Fate Episodes allow you to delve into the backstories of each member of your crew!", "achievements": {"highlighted": [{"archived": 0, "hidden": 0, "icon": "ef2dc8728efc95d8319a26586d2378d49b574d94.jpg", "localized_name": "Platinum Sky", "name": "Platinum Sky", "path": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/881020/ef2dc8728efc95d8319a26586d2378d49b574d94.jpg"}, {"archived": 0, "hidden": 1, "icon": "00ba341dcf6bc2932bc4baf02c2617b7db56f7ad.jpg", "localized_name": "Wings of Destruction", "name": "Wings of Destruction", "path": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/881020/00ba341dcf6bc2932bc4baf02c2617b7db56f7ad.jpg"}, {"archived": 0, "hidden": 1, "icon": "d228c1ac4ed91f5dd61d66535b7662fa1655a1ac.jpg", "localized_name": "The Ultimate", "name": "The Ultimate", "path": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/881020/d228c1ac4ed91f5dd61d66535b7662fa1655a1ac.jpg"}, {"archived": 0, "hidden": 1, "icon": "0feb30fc964b66dc75b98a3b0afc2ce99732ba31.jpg", "localized_name": "Id", "name": "Id", "path": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/881020/0feb30fc964b66dc75b98a3b0afc2ce99732ba31.jpg"}, {"archived": 0, "hidden": 1, "icon": "7e653d2efeaafe03720c674c1306f30316ca8039.jpg", "localized_name": "Skybound Heart", "name": "Skybound Heart", "path": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/881020/7e653d2efeaafe03720c674c1306f30316ca8039.jpg"}, {"archived": 0, "hidden": 0, "icon": "aca9f325b3c856cd8ee3edf442773a003cf08273.jpg", "localized_name": "Nothing Is Impossible!", "name": "Nothing Is Impossible!", "path": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/881020/aca9f325b3c856cd8ee3edf442773a003cf08273.jpg"}, {"archived": 0, "hidden": 0, "icon": "31964ad8dda763186f518c0c2b3bc21920810860.jpg", "localized_name": "Squad's All Here", "name": "Squad's All Here", "path": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/community_assets/images/apps/881020/31964ad8dda763186f518c0c2b3bc21920810860.jpg"}, 